# D1 migrations

The numbered SQL files are additive Cloudflare D1 migrations applied in order by Wrangler. They replace the legacy Flask `create_all`/Alembic path for the TypeScript runtime; do not run the legacy migration tooling against D1.

Current sequence:

- `0001` platform identity and rules;
- `0002` persistent world;
- `0003` persistent forces;
- `0004` strategic layer;
- `0005` equipment and deployment;
- `0006` production passwordless identity;
- `0007` guided onboarding and Battalion recruitment;
- `0008` authentication retention and invitation abuse controls;
- `0009` idempotent campaign-join command receipts;
- `0010` persistent campaign results and rewards;
- `0011` Battlegroup management receipts, compare-and-set revisions, and live roster/delegation uniqueness.
- `0012` actor-scoped active Battalion context switching receipts.
- `0013` exact-once self-departure and authorized member-removal receipts.
- `0014` rank/member-rank administration mutation tokens and actor-scoped receipts.
- `0015` atomic Battalion creator/command transfer tokens and receipt vocabulary.

Use the root `db:migrate:local` or guarded `db:migrate:remote` package scripts. Production-safe catalogue/onboarding seeds are separate from development fixtures.
